 # Cube SDF Grid Construction
 ## Overview
-Constructs a discrete Signed Distance Field (SDF) grid for a cube centered in the grid using analytical distance formulas for interior and exterior voxels [S1, unofficial]. It differs from its sibling [Sphere SDF Grid Construction](4895-sphere-sdf-grid-construction.md) by using box-based min/max operations rather than spherical symmetry and Euclidean distance from the center.
