 ## Subtopics
 
 ### [Sphere SDF Grid Construction](4895-sphere-sdf-grid-construction.md)
-Constructs a discrete SDF grid for a sphere using analytical implicit surface equations. Choose this for spherical primitives or tori; it uses spherical symmetry rather than box-based min/max operations.
